{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":70311,"seasonNumber":4},"checkedAt":1793441362959,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":4,"name":{"value":"Stagione 4","language":"it-IT"},"year":2020,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fm12uiJHuJ7EkDMkiUEBqeKE2GL.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"2298384","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"西湖封印松动，灵隐审判会判断撒朗还会有新动作，让唐月暗中保护身怀地圣泉的莫凡。然而具有戏剧性的一幕是，唐月将保护莫凡的任务交给青天猎所。包老头想要找他的亲戚保护莫凡，却被莫凡拒绝。另一方面，莫凡也察觉到了黑教廷会针对他下毒手。（事实上，明珠学府内部的确有黑教廷人员。）当天晚上，有学生（黑教廷底层人员）对莫凡进行攻击，莫凡与之交战。几个回合下来，莫凡将他们击败。萧院长得知了莫凡可能遭受威胁的情报，之后邀请莫凡到办公室喝茶，莫凡提出要使用去三步塔修炼的资格，这使萧院长更加坚信莫凡遭遇到了黑教廷的威胁。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-05-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":18,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5DxokBdo5l1zLpjHm80G75BRala.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5DxokBdo5l1zLpjHm80G75BRala.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/4/episode/1"},{"id":"2302523","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"莫凡进入三步塔修炼，成功取得突破，事后便遭到了三步塔守卫的暗中嫉妒。黑教廷欲计划利用明珠主校区考核夺取莫凡身上的地圣泉。宇昂放出暗影妖兽的假消息设计莫凡。许昭霆却先落入黑教廷的埋伏。为救下女友张璐璐，徐昭霆被黑教廷抓走。张璐璐被随后赶来的莫凡救下。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-05-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":22,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/67OEzrbxYOLhNJ0uKZXWLVyta9J.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/67OEzrbxYOLhNJ0uKZXWLVyta9J.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/4/episode/2"},{"id":"2302525","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"张璐璐被莫凡送往医院，在深夜张璐璐却遭到黑畜妖偷袭，张璐璐被带到医院天台上。另一边，许昭霆惨遭黑教廷毒手，被诅咒成了宇昂手下的黑畜妖。许昭霆被宇昂带到张璐璐所在医院天台上，宇昂命令许昭霆必须亲手了结张璐璐。许昭霆眼含泪水，被迫向张璐璐动手。随后莫凡赶来，人性未泯的许昭霆向莫凡提供了黑教廷蓝衣执事的线索。许昭霆要求莫凡将他火化，莫凡含泪实现了许昭霆的要求。莫凡悲痛不已，决定先发制人。莫凡回到学校，将一滴地圣泉放在暗影妖兽体内，借此引蛇出洞，果不其然发现内鬼傅天明。莫凡对傅天明等黑教廷成员出手，众人不明真相，反而围攻莫凡。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-06-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":22,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ihvMuJbq8DURPMnb5aeD9l26jqs.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ihvMuJbq8DURPMnb5aeD9l26jqs.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/4/episode/3"},{"id":"2302526","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"莫凡不慎掉入宇昂的陷阱，面对诅咒畜妖的猛烈攻击，莫凡命悬一线。此时，莫凡接到唐月命令要拖住宇昂的行动。原来蓝衣执事正在冒险逗留等待宇昂。再争取一些时间，审判员夜鹰就可实施抓捕。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-06-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":20,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/IOeBmABCVtAxvhxxgn2ydUxxHE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/IOeBmABCVtAxvhxxgn2ydUxxHE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/4/episode/4"},{"id":"2313244","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"拉锯战后，魔法阵消失，宇昂气急败坏，下令围绞莫凡。莫凡忍无可忍，释放玫炎气焰取得了胜利，宇昂见势急忙狼狈地逃离现场。身受重伤的莫凡却遭到了众人的污蔑，好在审判员夜鹰及时出现真相大白。考核风波结束后，莫凡、赵满延等人被定为交换生，将前往燕都学府。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-06-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":21,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hdOkWxRWfQLRI06eV7pcpCEOMCV.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hdOkWxRWfQLRI06eV7pcpCEOMCV.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/4/episode/5"},{"id":"2313245","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"莫凡无意间发现小泥鳅能凝练精魄，而凝练出的精魄只能用于强化星子。明珠学府、燕都学府两校展开激烈切磋，第一场团队赛明珠学府败北，第二场紧急赶到的莫凡对战燕都学府队长穆宁雪。在莫凡看似被穆宁雪完全碾压的时候，穆宁雪却说莫凡并没有使出真本事。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-06-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":20,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/adPOPQNMbvbgFaiNMOIz52Gn4mY.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/adPOPQNMbvbgFaiNMOIz52Gn4mY.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/4/episode/6"},{"id":"2313246","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"莫凡战胜穆宁雪，为明珠学府赢得最终的胜利。众人开始前往金林荒城进行历练，在穿越废弃隧道时却被洞穴魔奴袭击。众人发现此隧道实质上为洞穴魔奴的老巢，众人与之展开激战。莫凡“坐收渔翁之利”，趁机收纳了无数残魄。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-07-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":22,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/72lm3AXTr82gcCPFC4oLRF5odMS.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/72lm3AXTr82gcCPFC4oLRF5odMS.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/4/episode/7"},{"id":"2313247","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"几个回合下来，众人已筋疲力尽。最终众人成功突围，穿过隧道后成功逃脱。历练小队狼狈抵达荒城，又因误入伪怖魔设下的藤蔓捕食陷阱，牵扯出对莫凡的积怨。莫凡离队独行，在泥鳅坠的指引下，收获了更多精魄，并将伪怖魔种子收入囊中。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-07-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/u5qDIkw6X4H5k09DKxUj08v2Ek6.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u5qDIkw6X4H5k09DKxUj08v2Ek6.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/4/episode/8"},{"id":"2325127","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"大部队遭遇了绿皮大蜥的攻击，众人狼狈不堪。莫凡紧急重新加入了大部队，帮助众人摆脱了绿皮大蜥的纠缠。众人在短暂休息时却遭到了水蜘蛛的叮咬，众人均被水蜘蛛蛊惑，相互自相残杀，队伍乱成一团。莫凡和穆宁雪合力对抗蛊惑魔蛛，几个回合下来，仍然未对魔蛛造成伤筋动骨的打击，最终穆宁雪使用冰晶刹弓，消灭了魔蛛，众人的蛊惑因此被解除。而穆宁雪因无法承受使用冰晶刹弓带来的副作用而陷入昏迷。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-07-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":21,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xHxzU3Nh584PSrWl8zKvhPAnzVY.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xHxzU3Nh584PSrWl8zKvhPAnzVY.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/4/episode/9"},{"id":"2325423","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"众人伤亡惨重，已无心历练 ，一致决定原路返回。众人在折返路上却遇到陆年，本以为遇到军法师就安全的众人结果陆年却下了杀令，双方大打出手，五人当场丧命。莫凡用陆正河的性命威胁陆年，得知新系实验的真相，同时为穆宁雪争取第二次使用冰晶刹弓的时间。 分散逃命后， 莫凡一路诱敌深入，利用蜥颅巨妖威胁追敌。蜥颅巨妖的攻击猛烈，莫凡命悬一线。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-07-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":22,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pYUaYikuy6Eh7n5RciB8LLJaXNH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pYUaYikuy6Eh7n5RciB8LLJaXNH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/4/episode/10"},{"id":"2333390","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"在疾星狼的守护下，莫凡冲破枷锁升华了星子，使出烈拳九宫脱身。陆年俘虏了众人胁迫莫凡，斩空及时赶到与陆年开战。形势所逼，莫凡接受血利子，成功觉醒恶魔系。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-07-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":20,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oKT3hTWOXTRj3RD3mFsfGFLJLcR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oKT3hTWOXTRj3RD3mFsfGFLJLcR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/4/episode/11"},{"id":"2333391","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"友情大义当前，莫凡控制住恶魔系，救下众人。莫凡战退妖兽，现身惩治陆年。恶战结束，莫凡急需从恶魔异变之中恢复，但就连斩空也无能为力。斩空想要将恶魔莫凡带到卫部利用大量精魄尝试恢复，但恶魔莫凡最终却擅自离开，生死未卜。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-08-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":21,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/d3RMha71MKNA6kjtmP6UBAZ02Ei.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d3RMha71MKNA6kjtmP6UBAZ02Ei.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/4/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/4"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793441362959,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"2":{"checkedAt":1793441362959,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793441362959,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"4":{"checkedAt":1793441362959,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"5":{"checkedAt":1793441362959,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"6":{"checkedAt":1793441362959,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"7":{"checkedAt":1793441362959,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"8":{"checkedAt":1793441362959,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"9":{"checkedAt":1793441362959,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"10":{"checkedAt":1793441362959,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"11":{"checkedAt":1793441362959,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"12":{"checkedAt":1793441362959,"status":"ok","retryCount":0}}}
